                "headline": "Flood Watch issued September 13 at 1:55PM EDT until September 13 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Boston/Norton MA",
                "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall continues to be\npossible.\n\n* WHERE...Portions of eastern Connecticut and south central\nMassachusetts.\n\n* WHEN...Until 6 PM EDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Excessive runoff may result in flooding of low-lying and\nflood-prone locations. Flooding may occur in poor drainage and\nurban areas.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- Isolated heavy downpour this afternoon over saturated grounds may\nlead to isolated instances of flash flooding.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood",
